     --plan-cost`. This section must stay BELOW the forecast: the forecast
     parser reads the first token figure in its own section.
     A breakdown of what this order will report as its actual, not an addition. -->

**Measured: <N>k tokens so far** (main <N>k + planner <N>k) · <X>% of the forecast above

